  {
    "id": "graveyard-morbid-context",
    "source": "<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>Or—maybe it's the certainty of death in an otherwise-uncertain world. There's something comforting in that.</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>Hm. Morbid.</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>I prefer 'practical'.",
    "target": "<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>又或者——这世上什么都难以确定，唯有死亡是确定的。也许这让我感到些许安慰。</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>嗯，你这想法可够瘆人的。</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>我更愿意叫它“务实”。",
